---
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="story-grid items-start gap-10">
      <div>
        <span class="section-kicker">How it works</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading mt-6">
          One product flow, from the first urge to the pattern that shows up a month later.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-copy mt-6 max-w-2xl">
          Conscia works because it treats budgeting as behavior, not just bookkeeping. The product keeps
          the emotional context around every decision instead of flattening everything into a ledger.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card p-6">
        <div class="grid gap-4">
          <div class="mock-card p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="chip-gold">1. Set your baseline</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Onboarding wizard</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Pick your spending style, income range, and first budgets so the app can respond with the
              right amount of tension.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mock-card p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="chip-devil">2. Ask in the moment</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--devil-deep)]">Assistant + voice</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Use voice or text to describe a purchase and let the app map amount, category, and likely
              merchant before the money is gone.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mock-card p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="chip-angel">3. Capture what happened</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--angel-deep)]">Fast logging</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Log the real transaction with clean amount input, recent categories, location-aware
              suggestions, and budget updates that feel instant.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mock-card p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="chip-gold">4. Let memory kick in</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Reflection + alerts</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              Reflection sheets and regret alerts surface patterns like repeated hesitation, clustered
              splurges, and merchants you keep second-guessing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
